<termEntry>
<descrip>All environments where IT infrastructure elements are operated and provided under the Federal Act on Electronic Identification (BGEID) — namely the register, swiyu Wallet, swiyu Check, swiyu Service Portal and swiyu Trust Management Service. These elements can appear in different technical environments, such as production, sandbox, REF and ABN. They always represent instances and versions of a trust infrastructure.</descrip>
